dialect protocol
protocol s.stdio.semio.table.diff
version 1
schema s.stdio.semio.table
start body
framing record

# UNIFIED-COMPOSABLE-ARTIFACT-SYSTEM table wave: real binary diff frame. `format u8` + `presence
# u8` (bit0=`columns`, bit1=`rows`) are two REAL fixed fields; when present, each section follows
# as a real varint count + per-item repeated record — modeled as one opaque trailing `payload`
# chain (the `protocol-array-of-records` gap every sibling subset's own diff protocol uses at this
# boundary). The real Rust `encode_diff`/`decode_diff` (`../../🦀️.rs`) stays genuinely,
# fully structured — round-trip tested independently.
header fixed 2
field format u8
field presence u8

chain payload bytes
